WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.515
Roxy looked outside.

2
00:00:06.516 --> 00:00:09.962
The Electric Elves ran to their motorcycles.

3
00:00:09.963 --> 00:00:13.930
Zap! Electricity shot from the elf leader's hand.

4
00:00:13.931 --> 00:00:16.261
All the motorcycles started up.

5
00:00:16.262 --> 00:00:19.944
Rumble! Rumble!

6
00:00:19.945 --> 00:00:27.724
The Electric Elves hopped onto the motorcycles and rode away.

7
00:00:27.725 --> 00:00:31.353
"Grr!" Roxy stamped her foot.

8
00:00:31.354 --> 00:00:34.506
"The elves' clubhouse is really far from here.

9
00:00:34.507 --> 00:00:36.684
And I can't fly!"

10
00:00:36.685 --> 00:00:41.957
Roxy sighed. "I've lost my super powers.

11
00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:44.386
But I'm still Rocket Girl.

12
00:00:44.387 --> 00:00:49.386
And Rocket Girl can still stop those elves!"

13
00:00:49.387 --> 00:00:52.487
Roxy went outside and stomped down the street.

14
00:00:52.488 --> 00:00:54.995
A few people stared at her.

15
00:00:54.996 --> 00:00:58.296
"That's strange," said a man with a dog.

16
00:00:58.297 --> 00:01:05.998
"Rocket Girl is taking a walk!"

17
00:01:05.999 --> 00:01:10.633
"Why aren't you flying, Rocket Girl?" asked a little girl.

18
00:01:10.634 --> 00:01:16.217
Roxy sighed and kept walking.

19
00:01:16.218 --> 00:01:19.449
Finally she got to the Electric Elves' clubhouse.

20
00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:22.446
She was tired and she was mad!

21
00:01:22.447 --> 00:01:26.052
The elves' motorcycles were parked in front of the clubhouse.

22
00:01:26.053 --> 00:01:29.214
Electricity buzzed all around them.

23
00:01:29.215 --> 00:01:32.170
Roxy kicked a motorcycle hard.

24
00:01:32.171 --> 00:01:34.379
Zap! Zap!

25
00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:37.484
"Whoa!" Roxy felt another shock.

26
00:01:37.485 --> 00:01:40.128
Electricity buzzed through her again.

27
00:01:40.129 --> 00:01:43.659
And then suddenly . . .

28
00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:47.543
Whiz-hoo! Her eye laser beams fired!

29
00:01:47.544 --> 00:01:51.982
The elves' motorcycles exploded into little pieces.

30
00:01:51.983 --> 00:01:57.569
"Yes!" Roxy cheered. "Rocket Girl is back!"

31
